    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></math><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(constant)</p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> given</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
